8828/thailand-has-had-enough-foreign-tourists-behaving-badly?utm_source=rss_feed","source":"SCMP (홍콩)","summary":"At a zoo a short drive south of Bangkok, Charoon Youngprapakorn has spent a lifetime taking the pulse of Thailand’s tourism industry from an unlikely vantage point: the open jaws of crocodiles. Handlers at his Samut Prakan Crocodile Farm & Zoo have long thrilled onlookers by coaxing tips from the audience and carefully placing the money into the mouths of animals capable of taking off an entire ha","published":"2026-09-26T09:00:18+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":0,"title_ko":"태국은 외국인 관광객들이 나쁘게 행동할 만큼","summary_ko":"방콕에서 남쪽으로 조금 떨어진 동물원에서 Charoon Youngprapakorn은 평생 동안 태국 관광 산업의 맥박을 악어의 열린 턱이라는 희귀한 관점에서 바라보았습니다. 그의 Samut Prakan Crocodile Farm & Zoo의 핸들러는 오랫동안 관객의 팁을 동축하고 전체를 벗을 수있는 동물의 입에 조심스럽게 돈을 넣어 구경꾼을 흥분 시켰습니다."},{"title":"Iran war live: Tehran offers US plan to reopen Hormuz within seven days","url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/9/26/iran-war-live-tehran-offers-us-plan-to-reopen-hormuz-within-seven-days?traffic_source=rss","source":"Al Jazeera","summary":"Iran's FM says the \"choice rests with the US\" to approve the proposed seven-day proposal to reopen Hormuz.","published":"2026-09-26T09:00:00+09:00","lang":"en","related_total":7,"title_ko":"이란 전쟁 생중계: 테헤란, 미국에 7일 이내에 호르무즈 재개 계획 제안","summary_ko":"이란의 FM은 호르무즈 재개를 위한 7일간의 제안을 승인하기 위한 \"선택은 미국에 달려있다\" 고 말한다."},{"title":"시진핑 방중 종료...올해 두번 더 트럼프 만난다","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFB4S1VRTlZQSDBxV1VFM2dDbk02dkZiQnAwMTVuYTZJQ19TcmdsWmVWZW92OFAwU0hEZDVHbGFMdUNhemdRU2FQZm9nanZZTjA?oc=5","source":"다음뉴스","summary":"","published":"2026-09-26T08:59:26+09:00","related_total":0}]},"slim":true}